Patch 0006-mtp-shard-filter.patch for vLLM, base commit 8e2beaa3bff595577a069d49d96bde9074294ec2 (vllm/vllm-openai:nightly-8e2beaa3bff595577a069d49d96bde9074294ec2).
What: Lets the MTP drafter's load skip checkpoint shards that hold none of its tensors (3 of 11 shards read instead of all), as vLLM's Qwen3.5 and Qwen3-Next drafters already do.
Upstream: no vLLM PR. written for this recipe.
This file modifies vLLM (Apache-2.0); the vLLM copyright and SPDX lines in the files it changes are kept.

